    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ANNA: You’re tuned to Bludso on the radio. Stage one of my dramatic transformation is almost complete.\nLINDA: Oh my God you are such a child.\nANNA: Well. I’m an actual child, so... -- Ahhh.\nLINDA: It just means it’s working.",
      "EXEC: The call was for a Downtown Julie Brown type...\nANNA: Someone worldly, articulate, knowledgeable. Charismatic. Black.\nEXEC: Assistant at Culture for... four years? They never gave you a shot?\nANNA: Only so many spots in Culture.",
      "SISTA SOUL: There’s nothing we can do? Edna this is your channel!\nEDNA: Grant’s been edging me out since the merger, ya’ll. It’s my time.\nBROOK LYNNE: I just got a condo, I can’t go back to radio.\nANNA: Edna... my promotion.",
      "BROOK LYNNE: All I know is Sandra better not give us no more bubble gum shit.\nSISTA SOUL: You know she stays aiming for the white charts.\nANNA: Shhh...",
      "SISTA SOUL: Or a really good relaxer maybe?\nBROOK LYNNE: Naw, my shit don’t move like that and I’m part Cherokee.\nANNA: A what now?\nBROOK LYNE: Oh, weave? My girl Tanitra started doing them. Expensive as hell."
    ]
  },
